# The frontend arrived with CRLF endings on every tracked file, which made its
# whole history unreadable in a diff. Normalize to LF in the repository and on
# checkout, so a Windows editor cannot rewrite 9,800 lines by touching one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
